_7321913003346408327_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FOQQm942XPgQ7kNvwHt3_12&_nc_oc=AdrzlmRIjA2ouRLSgwcPAsi0cwd90Eddubk4QN1SM6PeKd6CnsyXG_Orp-jNE51rh5M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIGtls1pTNhNeXAN5c5mDdnWVUl8Bpnk5rb5RJahm3eNw&oe=6AABF8C3"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot5.png", "id": "3827117000946530", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75340709_3827117004279863_2151149415370285711_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jL4oY-xbje8Q7kNvwG_frfh&_nc_oc=Adpcvvky4h7foi2DLpVVavxOyNA-R6_Vpph8M64eyMbTKrnop5eIAd_EqFipz_ho7CU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK9t2vaSEhiVgMtfRajVNvFQXmLs65OqS3CwKYCtY37IQ&oe=6AABE9FC"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "1329895131046853", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982642_1329895134380186_3255244674483954341_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tm2SUVnbCzcQ7kNvwE2C1su&_nc_oc=Adq0eel5q5hMoS_YnTlg_gCZrw0SysfEQGA93U9AwnhD8R52RXZAPJphr0JyCnhUxfs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIBwmm64kMuPoBoZWRyhWz6Z34wy5THJd-m_tR7PHa8Fg&oe=6AAC0CE2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_V8_Landscape.png", "id": "4187032411551185", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821178_4187032414884518_6684493733824043119_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0oRxsvup8PoQ7kNvwGG58XG&_nc_oc=AdpSKAil7fTt_6_oWcf6dCwMQPmRPYPW4BW9xyirJYMF8YKq6tJKBIftrupIXTzIFII&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKckJtL8y_I3o8smV4x4mHYi2NPL5scFFl5U4X49zezDA&oe=6AABF32D"}, "display_name": "VAIL", "keywords": ["shooter", "fps", "multiplayer", "social", "extraction"], "long_description": "The highest-rated VR shooter is FREE. VAIL delivers precision-crafted gunplay, 10+ competitive modes, and a massive free Extraction island. \nCustomize your gear, squad up, and see why VAIL has 4.8 stars across 67K reviews.\n\n{1419076756672610}\n\n\n#  **TRAINING GROUNDS (FREE-TO-PLAY)**\nJump in with nothing. Random maps, weapon pickups, and loadout modifiers designed to get you into real gunfights fast. To know what VAIL's gunplay actually feels like in your hands.\n\n{826869113772460}\n{1861007317926953}\n\n#  **EXTRACTION (FREE EARLY ACCESS)**\nDescend into the depths of Reyn. Extract encrypted data, technology, and resources while autonomous drones guard every corridor like archangels. A free, high-stakes mode that rewards patience, precision, and knowing when to run.\n\n{2038611673568486}\n{906663608919767}\n\n\n#  **SOCIAL HUB (FREE-TO-PLAY)**\nVAIL's Social Hub is the center of gravity. Hang out, shoot, Challenge players to 1v1s, or mine ORE shards from the quarry to unlock rewards.\n\n{911511758042190}\n\n\n\n#  **VAIL COMBAT (UNLOCKABLE)**\n\nThis is what VAIL was built for. Team Deathmatch, Seek and Destroy, Free for All, and 10+ more modes. Full progression, 8 prestiges, leaderboards, stats, competitive, and the complete weapon and cosmetics system. Upgrade once, play forever.\n\n{1220581586247000}\n{1547957886294186}\n\n\n\n# **CRITICALLY ACCLAIMED**\nVR Game of the Year Finalist - VR Awards 2022 / People's Voice: Best VR Game - Webby Awards 2024 / Best Social/Interactive - VRDB Community Choice Awards 2024\nVoted by the community. Verified by 67,000+ reviews. 4.8 stars on the Quest store.\n\n{988770307650678}\n\nJoin the community!\nDiscord.gg/VAILVR\n\n{875677118774648}\n\n", "short_description": "The highest-rated VR shooter is FREE. VAIL delivers precision-crafted gunplay, 10+ competitive modes, and a massive free Extraction island. \nCustomize your gear, squad up, and see why VAIL has 4.8 stars across 67K reviews."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aexlab.com/aexlab/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AEXLAB", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vailvr.com/", "categ